{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49435","headline":"女冠子 二 · 薛昭藴","name":"女冠子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云罗雾縠，新授明威法籙，降真函。\n髻绾青丝发，冠抽碧玉篸。\n往来云过五，去住岛经三。\n正遇刘郎使，啓瑶缄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}